112
00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:48.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:55.952 --> 00:08:58.329 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:59.413 --> 00:09:01.082 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅仅是炸弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:09:01.165 --> 00:09:03.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有烟雾弹和闪光弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:09:03.501 --> 00:09:05.586 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真是个手艺人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.549 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你费心了
-别放在心上</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:09.632 --> 00:09:12.552 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些东西怎样都能处理掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:14.470 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:18.975 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剩下的就靠你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:22.937 --> 00:09:23.980 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:29.277 --> 00:09:32.488 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！深更半夜你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:34.574 --> 00:09:35.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 问你话呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:37.326 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:38.369 --> 00:09:39.579 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去哪…</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:42.123 --> 00:09:44.750 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去哪才好呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:45.960 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:49.463 --> 00:09:51.424 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跑在他前面了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:10:02.935 --> 00:10:05.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克！</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:14.739 --> 00:10:17.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:18.326 --> 00:10:19.827 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>站起来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:20.536 --> 00:10:22.622 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-放手！
-烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:22.705 --> 00:10:24.290 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你惹太多麻烦了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:24.373 --> 00:10:26.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我们回家！
-你自己回！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:27.752 --> 00:10:29.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还有事没做完！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:29.712 --> 00:10:32.715 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别管我了 你个叛徒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:32.798 --> 00:10:36.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？我什么时候变成叛徒了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:40.598 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是和那个维新志士合伙
破坏我的计划吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:40.681 --> 00:10:42.016 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:42.099 --> 00:10:46.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的计划我没对别人透露一个字！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:46.479 --> 00:10:48.564 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那为什么那家伙会出现在那里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:49.774 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我怎么知道！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:49.857 --> 00:10:52.485 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙一向爱管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:52.568 --> 00:10:54.236 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会相信你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.113 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把我的十年还回来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:11:01.869 --> 00:11:04.538 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>像个流氓一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:04.622 --> 00:11:07.166 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这样也算赤报队的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:13.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克…你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:23.849 --> 00:11:25.351 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别误会了</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:26.143 --> 00:11:29.063 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对付你们 我用拳头就够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:29.814 --> 00:11:31.482 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我放心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:31.565 --> 00:11:36.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为你的灵魂
已经堕落到这种地步了</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:38.114 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别放心的太早了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:42.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从来没有打赢过我</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:42.451 --> 00:11:43.744 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>住口</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:57.299 --> 00:11:59.927 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-根本不痛不痒
-我也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.346 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你太浪荡了 左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.682 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:16.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:17.069 --> 00:12:19.613 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架你怎么可能是我的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:20.239 --> 00:12:22.992 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…这不是打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:26.245 --> 00:12:29.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我洗刷赤报队十年来的怨恨</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:33.043 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>夺回荣耀的战斗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:34.545 --> 00:12:37.506 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我不能输 我不能输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:41.927 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助 我这十年
不像你过的那么轻松！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:43.679 --> 00:12:45.473 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:45.556 --> 00:12:48.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长受到那样的侮辱</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:48.225 --> 00:12:52.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队被明治政府冠上罪名的这十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:52.438 --> 00:12:54.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你都干了什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:54.356 --> 00:12:55.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你日夜不停地打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:56.025 --> 00:12:59.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打到最后
跟前维新志士做好朋友了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:59.904 --> 00:13:05.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从赤报队和队长
身上都学了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:08.204 --> 00:13:09.788 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:13:10.789 --> 00:13:13.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有什么资格说这些！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:13:13.083 --> 00:13:14.585 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你又怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:13:14.668 --> 00:13:18.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年里把自己关起来造炸弹？</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:13:18.422 --> 00:13:23.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想为队长洗刷污名
还有很多别的方法！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:13:23.093 --> 00:13:27.973 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且现在才告发政府
已经晚了十年！</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:13:29.141 --> 00:13:31.227 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:33.687 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管过去十年我们多么郁闷</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:33.771 --> 00:13:35.648 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论明治政府有多腐败</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:35.731 --> 00:13:39.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>镇上的人们
都在靠自己努力创造着新时代！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:40.778 --> 00:13:42.571 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也亲眼看到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:42.655 --> 00:13:44.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个道场的小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:44.365 --> 00:13:48.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了在明治时代传播剑术每天奔波</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:48.285 --> 00:13:53.666 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦出身武士家庭
虽然现在等于是被弃之不顾了</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:53.749 --> 00:13:58.128 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他仍然日夜坚持练习竹刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:58.754 --> 00:14:02.591 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>女医师惠
虽然被卷入了肮脏的生意里</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:14:02.675 --> 00:14:05.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但她振作起来救治镇上的病人</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:14:06.053 --> 00:14:07.638 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>修和银次</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:14:07.721 --> 00:14:10.724 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从来不抱怨他们的现状</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:14:10.808 --> 00:14:12.059 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>每天都很辛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:14:12.142 --> 00:14:14.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使这样也一直保持笑容！</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:15.437 --> 00:14:17.773 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一群有不同的经历的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:17.856 --> 00:14:20.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>昨晚一起坐下来喝酒吃饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:14:21.068 --> 00:14:23.404 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这难道不就是队长梦想中的</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:14:23.487 --> 00:14:26.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>四民平等的时代吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:14:26.407 --> 00:14:27.575 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:14:28.367 --> 00:14:30.119 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想做的事呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:30.202 --> 00:14:32.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没意义！添乱罢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:40.337 --> 00:14:42.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没意义？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:46.969 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:47.928 --> 00:14:51.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你切腹自尽也没法改变世界的</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:56.478 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有人都活在现在的新时代里</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:57.897 --> 00:14:59.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:15:02.192 --> 00:15:05.654 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助 拔刀斋在哪里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:05.738 --> 00:15:10.159 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果他把我的炸弹都上交给政府…</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:10.242 --> 00:15:13.662 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过 他不是那种人</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:14.955 --> 00:15:17.708 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他跟我们一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:15:17.791 --> 00:15:21.295 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>并不能从心底认同如今政府的现状</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:25.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…作为建设了新政府的一份子</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:25.925 --> 00:15:27.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他比我们更不能认同</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:27.885 --> 00:15:29.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你胡说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.972 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一个刽子手怎么会懂我们？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:15:32.056 --> 00:15:33.349 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:35.893 --> 00:15:39.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是明治维新时期
在暗地里活跃的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:44.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了暗杀活动
还做过很多其他肮脏的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:44.944 --> 00:15:46.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正因为如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:51.158 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他无法眼睁睁看着
我们赤报队也做出这些肮脏勾当</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:53.369 --> 00:15:54.495 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道吗 阿克？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:59.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说在赤报队成立前
队长也做过一些不法的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.878 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我觉得那并不是他的本意</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:08.008 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队是个以四民平等为理想的队伍</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:08.717 --> 00:16:11.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>事到如今 我们更不能玷污它的名誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:16.809 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>肮脏不肮脏有什么关系！</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:16.892 --> 00:16:20.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了达到目的必须不择手段</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:20.854 --> 00:16:21.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:22.648 --> 00:16:26.735 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们赤报队就真的是伪军了</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:29.029 --> 00:16:31.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家都不肯买啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:31.699 --> 00:16:34.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>伪军头目的画</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:39.498 --> 00:16:45.546 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你说政府那些家伙很肮脏
你就不能跟他们一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:45.629 --> 00:16:48.590 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>沉稳也好 谨慎也罢</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:55.055 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要践行一条
让队长在天上也可以微笑的路</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:51.653 --> 00:17:52.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:53.989 --> 00:17:58.160 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助好像吃了克浩的鱼什么的</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:58.744 --> 00:18:01.121 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像往常一样打起来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:18:01.205 --> 00:18:02.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.750 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>加油 左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:18:04.833 --> 00:18:06.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快打倒他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:18:06.418 --> 00:18:09.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克 别认输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:18:09.171 --> 00:18:11.632 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>被打败都别认输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:18:11.715 --> 00:18:14.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了！你赢不了我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:18:14.802 --> 00:18:16.136 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:19.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你抢走的东西抢回来之前
我是不会输的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:18:19.515 --> 00:18:21.391 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:18:22.935 --> 00:18:25.062 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 左之助？</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:18:25.145 --> 00:18:27.523 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩！腿！</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:18:31.527 --> 00:18:32.694 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩…</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:34.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赢了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:34.738 --> 00:18:36.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>干得好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:39.827 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>疼…</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:41.495 --> 00:18:43.288 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你干得很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:45.332 --> 00:18:48.544 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要用你自己的方式战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:59.012 --> 00:19:01.306 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的方式…</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:19:09.523 --> 00:19:13.360 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈津南后来怎么样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:19:13.443 --> 00:19:14.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:19:15.779 --> 00:19:19.032 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为我毫不留情打了他一顿</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:19:19.116 --> 00:19:20.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再见他会很尴尬啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:19:22.786 --> 00:19:27.040 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 这不是上次的小哥嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:19:27.124 --> 00:19:28.667 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来得正好</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:19:29.543 --> 00:19:31.670 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>上次真是不好意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:19:31.753 --> 00:19:32.754 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:32.838 --> 00:19:37.467 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈先生有东西托我交给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:38.552 --> 00:19:41.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说这是他最后的锦绘了</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:43.182 --> 00:19:45.309 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不知道他在想什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:45.392 --> 00:19:49.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>突然告诉我他要开始做插画报</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:49.229 --> 00:19:50.772 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来揭露政府的不公</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.360 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟他说管制很严的 别做了</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:55.444 --> 00:20:00.199 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难得是那么有人气的画师呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:20:01.658 --> 00:20:04.828 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是遗憾啊 大叔</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:21:43.218 --> 00:21:46.555 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>前几日的骚动到底是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:21:47.264 --> 00:21:48.265 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:21:48.348 --> 00:21:51.727 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>内院花园有数处被烧</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:54.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>另外有一部分墙面受损</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:21:55.022 --> 00:21:58.567 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是所有设施和人都没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有人声明对此次事件负责</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:22:00.485 --> 00:22:04.031 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是否有人恶意捣乱的调查正在进行中</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:22:04.114 --> 00:22:05.782 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>春天来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:22:05.866 --> 00:22:07.868 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>奇怪的人也出来活动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:22:08.785 --> 00:22:09.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:14.666 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄一派会不会与此有关？</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:16.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别胡说！</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:18.795 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们袭击内务省？</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:22:18.879 --> 00:22:20.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:22:21.089 --> 00:22:23.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-川路
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:22:23.133 --> 00:22:27.679 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>东京附近没有收到
志志雄一派的目击报告</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:22:27.763 --> 00:22:30.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请放心 大久保卿</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:22:32.434 --> 00:22:36.229 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果是他们做的 不会没有人员伤亡</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:22:36.313 --> 00:22:39.441 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但也不能掉以轻心</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:22:39.524 --> 00:22:42.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-继续调查
-是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:22:44.738 --> 00:22:48.867 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集
《明治剑客浪漫谭 第零幕前篇》</c.simplifiedchinese>

